{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>For coals</b> — When he remembers the food and drink that you gave him, it will burn him as though you heaped coals on his head to burn him, and he will beware of doing evil to you." "<b>It will be repaid to you</b> — The recompense of your kindness."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:24:42.539583429Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}